## Dependencias com outros squads

| Dependencia                 | Squad responsavel | Tipo de interacao                           |
|-----------------------------|-------------------|---------------------------------------------|
| Picker de contatos          | squad-pipeline    | fornecer `GET /contacts/for-pipeline`       |
| Tags CRUD global            | squad-tags        | consumir via `addTagToContact`/`removeTag`  |
| Timeline de mensagens       | squad-inbox       | consumir `messages` no detalhe              |
| Dashboard stats             | squad-dashboard   | fornecer dados via `Contact` Prisma         |
| Auth, sessao, tenant        | squad-auth        | consumir `auth()`, `apiServer()`            |

